      "bottomRightX": 645,
      "bottomRightY": 815,
      "content": "$$\\psi_n^{(3)} = \\sum_{n'}' \\left(G_{nn'}^{(3,1)}\\chi_{ns}^{(2)}\\phi_{n'}^{(0)} + G_{nn'}^{(3,2)}\\chi_{ns}^{(1)}\\phi_{n'}^{(0)} + G_{nn'}^{(3,3)}\\chi_{ns}^{(0)}\\phi_{n'}^{(0)}\\right), \\tag{60}$$",
